+## R-C3 short content and whole-post coverage
+
+The adapter supports frozen r15 `zk60_classify.r15.release.bin`, SHA256
+`5edb7241f3c6b788289fca4a03f4fd40649355cf016663ec9dadbdaaa66c9a8e`, with
